NAME: Timer

DESCRIPTION:

Countdown timer. The display
is minutes:seconds.

START asks for the interval.
Enter minutes, or minutes and
seconds. Seconds are optional.

  5     is 5 minutes
  5.30  is 5 minutes 30 seconds
  0.45  is 45 seconds

PAUSE freezes the countdown.
RESUME continues it.
CANCEL clears the timer.

When the time is up, the
display counts negative
(-0:01, -1:05) and Morse
code H plays until CANCEL.

If you leave while it is
running, the countdown
continues when you return.
If it expired while you were
away, the alarm starts.

If you leave while it is
paused, the remaining time
is kept.

If you leave while the alarm
is playing, the alarm stops.

NOTES:

Developed with AI assistance.
